,"depth":3,"id":"returns-3","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Store"},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"T"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TActions"},{"type":"text","value":">"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"example-3","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example"}]},{"type":"code","value":"const counterStore = useCreateStore({ count: 0 })","lang":"tsx"}],"headings":[{"id":"readonly-store","text":"Readonly store","level":2},{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":3},{"id":"t","text":"T","level":4},{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":3},{"id":"getvalue","text":"getValue","level":4},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":3},{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":3},{"id":"writable-store","text":"Writable store","level":2},{"id":"type-parameters-2","text":"Type Parameters","level":3},{"id":"t-2","text":"T","level":4},{"id":"parameters-2","text":"Parameters","level":3},{"id":"initialvalue","text":"initialValue","level":4},{"id":"returns-2","text":"Returns","level":3},{"id":"example-2","text":"Example","level":3},{"id":"store-with-actions","text":"Store with actions","level":2},{"id":"type-parameters-3","text":"Type Parameters","level":3},{"id":"t-3","text":"T","level":4},{"id":"tactions","text":"TActions","level":4},{"id":"parameters-3","text":"Parameters","level":3},{"id":"initialvalue-2","text":"initialValue","level":4},{"id":"actions","text":"actions","level":4},{"id":"returns-3","text":"Returns","level":3},{"id":"example-3","text":"Example","level":3}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n## Readonly store\n\n```ts\nfunction useCreateStore<T>(getValue): ReadonlyStore<T>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [octane-store/src/useCreateStore.ts:25](https://github.com/TanStack/store/blob/main/packages/octane-store/src/useCreateStore.ts#L25)\n\nCreates a stable store instance for the lifetime of the component.\n\nPass an initial value to create a writable store, or a getter function to\ncreate a readonly derived store. This hook mirrors the overloads from\ncreateStore, but ensures the store is only created once per mount.\n\n### Type Parameters\n\n#### T\n\n`T`\n\n### Parameters\n\n#### getValue\n\n(`prev?`) => `T`\n\n### Returns\n\n`ReadonlyStore`\\<`T`\\>\n\n### Example\n\n```tsx\nconst counterStore = useCreateStore({ count: 0 })\n```\n\n## Writable store\n\n```ts\nfunction useCreateStore<T>(initialValue): Store<T>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [octane-store/src/useCreateStore.ts:28](https://github.com/TanStack/store/blob/main/packages/octane-store/src/useCreateStore.ts#L28)\n\nCreates a stable store instance for the lifetime of the component.\n\nPass an initial value to create a writable store, or a getter function to\ncreate a readonly derived store. This hook mirrors the overloads from\ncreateStore, but ensures the store is only created once per mount.\n\n### Type Parameters\n\n#### T\n\n`T`\n\n### Parameters\n\n#### initialValue\n\n`T`\n\n### Returns\n\n`Store`\\<`T`\\>\n\n### Example\n\n```tsx\nconst counterStore = useCreateStore({ count: 0 })\n```\n\n## Store with actions\n\n```ts\nfunction useCreateStore<T, TActions>(initialValue, actions): Store<T, TActions>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [octane-store/src/useCreateStore.ts:29](https://github.com/TanStack/store/blob/main/packages/octane-store/src/useCreateStore.ts#L29)\n\nCreates a stable store instance for the lifetime of the component.\n\nPass an initial value to create a writable store, or a getter function to\ncreate a readonly derived store. This hook mirrors the overloads from\ncreateStore, but ensures the store is only created once per mount.\n\n### Type Parameters\n\n#### T\n\n`T`\n\n#### TActions\n\n`TActions` *extends* `StoreActionMap`\n\n### Parameters\n\n#### initialValue\n\n`NonFunction`\\<`T`\\>\n\n#### actions\n\n`StoreActionsFactory`\\<`T`, `TActions`\\>\n\n### Returns\n\n`Store`\\<`T`, `TActions`\\>\n\n### Example\n\n```tsx\nconst counterStore = useCreateStore({ count: 0 })\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: useCreateStore\ntitle: useCreateStore\n---\n\n## Readonly store\n\n```ts\nfunction useCreateStore<T>(getValue): ReadonlyStore<T>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [octane-store/src/useCreateStore.ts:25](https://github.com/TanStack/store/blob/main/packages/octane-store/src/useCreateStore.ts#L25)\n\nCreates a stable store instance for the lifetime of the component.\n\nPass an initial value to create a writable store, or a getter function to\ncreate a readonly derived store. This hook mirrors the overloads from\ncreateStore, but ensures the store is only created once per mount.\n\n### Type Parameters\n\n#### T\n\n`T`\n\n### Parameters\n\n#### getValue\n\n(`prev?`) => `T`\n\n### Returns\n\n`ReadonlyStore`\\<`T`\\>\n\n### Example\n\n```tsx\nconst counterStore = useCreateStore({ count: 0 })\n```\n\n## Writable store\n\n```ts\nfunction useCreateStore<T>(initialValue): Store<T>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [octane-store/src/useCreateStore.ts:28](https://github.com/TanStack/store/blob/main/packages/octane-store/src/useCreateStore.ts#L28)\n\nCreates a stable store instance for the lifetime of the component.\n\nPass an initial value to create a writable store, or a getter function to\ncreate a readonly derived store. This hook mirrors the overloads from\ncreateStore, but ensures the store is only created once per mount.\n\n### Type Parameters\n\n#### T\n\n`T`\n\n### Parameters\n\n#### initialValue\n\n`T`\n\n### Returns\n\n`Store`\\<`T`\\>\n\n### Example\n\n```tsx\nconst counterStore = useCreateStore({ count: 0 })\n```\n\n## Store with actions\n\n```ts\nfunction useCreateStore<T, TActions>(initialValue, actions): Store<T, TActions>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [octane-store/src/useCreateStore.ts:29](https://github.com/TanStack/store/blob/main/packages/octane-store/src/useCreateStore.ts#L29)\n\nCreates a stable store instance for the lifetime of the component.\n\nPass an initial value to create a writable store, or a getter function to\ncreate a readonly derived store. This hook mirrors the overloads from\ncreateStore, but ensures the store is only created once per mount.\n\n### Type Parameters\n\n#### T\n\n`T`\n\n#### TActions\n\n`TActions` *extends* `StoreActionMap`\n\n### Parameters\n\n#### initialValue\n\n`NonFunction`\\<`T`\\>\n\n#### actions\n\n`StoreActionsFactory`\\<`T`, `TActions`\\>\n\n### Returns\n\n`Store`\\<`T`, `TActions`\\>\n\n### Example\n\n```tsx\nconst counterStore = useCreateStore({ count: 0 })\n```\n"}
